{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5fc4e1db6884a7893450abde5a52995579ffb5e44299662c42f44bb9f1a83998", "ja": "（今日は、次の定期公演のミーティング。\nセンターになる環の新曲が届いた）", "zh": "（今天是下一场定期公演的会议。\n担任中心的环的新歌送到了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_1001_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_1002_p", "source_sha256": "20c35993ef0e5f0023611a7ce8ab88bf882122e2a98f25de2f9035c57b03d6eb", "ja": "お、みんな揃ってるな。\nお疲れ様！", "zh": "哦，大家都到齐了啊。\n辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_1003_005yay", "source_sha256": "6740cf029b92d6608bf634559e9ef32156536331499b8cfa23150bb8195c7742", "ja": "お疲れさまですー！\n私たちが最後だったみたいですね。", "zh": "辛苦啦——！\n看来我们是最后到的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "41088fcee7b4c14437c24cb9ddb08c274ccff557f069aa40a8ac1206e1cfc4f4", "ja": "あっ、やよい、杏奈ちゃん。\nふたりとも、お疲れさま！", "zh": "啊，弥生、杏奈。\n你们两个辛苦啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "60fb3913888fe3e96519d21184c6dd4480467d1fa3fc1edbfacf03a8849fe47e", "ja": "今日は、『中学生ダイアリー』の収録だったんだよね？\nどうだった？", "zh": "今天是录制《中学生日记》，对吧？\n感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "9cef84a26f10583424eb0479d5f7d8fb91037f4bf179e3c3b1f4f2a5832d6afc", "ja": "うん……杏奈、ゲストで……緊張したけど……。\nやよいちゃんが、アシストしてくれたから……。", "zh": "嗯……杏奈作为嘉宾……虽然很紧张……但因为弥生帮了我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_1007_005yay", "source_sha256": "698440bb14525e15f42de28cd6afd5ef615c2b126177b8a7dbae9462b1720a11", "ja": "私は杏奈ちゃんといっしょで、すっごく楽しかったよ！\nまたゲストに来てほしいなーって！", "zh": "我和杏奈一起，特别开心哦！还想着希望她下次再来当嘉宾呢——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "4343bfbe669573c7fa8ad0e83197aee342b25515a1f93bab68fb23c2f1ae4719", "ja": "『中学生ダイアリー』、いいな～。\nおやぶん、たまきも早く出たい！", "zh": "《初中生日记》，真不错啊～。\n大亲，环也想早点登场！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_1009_p", "source_sha256": "2edb62a1ffc1ba25115490f87803e9a81c14bedbe03fbeeba1b121c24388f560", "ja": "そうだな。環が中学生になったら、\nオーディションを受けような！", "zh": "是啊。等环上了初中，就去参加试镜吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "e7e7c3e175fe57c404e151dc8dd68354f113d9960eea1629b5ce4c017f0058f1", "ja": "うん！　たまきがんばって、絶対合格する！", "zh": "嗯！环会加油，绝对要通过！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_1011_005yay", "source_sha256": "b93062b98421c5d1551bfa99973258c33b2b73c5ccd0dc9709df4e47dbef8bab", "ja": "そしたら、環ちゃんともいっしょにお仕事できるね！", "zh": "这样就能和环酱一起工作了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "0bacc5dd02be8b4878a66025cb242ecb811aa7fc3acb12a39ca28610c6f4d352", "ja": "うん！　あ、そうだ！\nやよいちゃんとあんなも、公園行く？", "zh": "嗯！啊，对了！\n要和弥生、杏奈一起去公园吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_1013_p", "source_sha256": "6bb0ef3f56a89b4e4e436e19f7e3ca0ff07b929ea9fa6f9aca0a5584f667bb7d", "ja": "公園もいいけど、その前にミーティングだな！\n環、終わったら行っていいぞ。", "zh": "公园也不错，不过在那之前得先开会！\n小环，结束后你就可以去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_1014_040tam", "source_sha256": "c0855774b74f07387d8f2d11c21de1da1fd4193c5da73fcda253738262ce1c96", "ja": "わかった！\nおやぶんのお仕事の話、聞く！", "zh": "知道啦！\n环会好好听老大讲工作的事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_1015_p", "source_sha256": "6e97e06f3596ddea548f6ae0edcd5bffff56ef9f1fb855063c97717181848a9d", "ja": "うん、いい子だな！　早速だけど、\nこの5人で次の定期公演を行う。", "zh": "嗯，真乖！虽然有点突然，\n但接下来这5个人要举行下一次的定期公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_1016_p", "source_sha256": "313530d6b8dca840b4ff7cc24c2449441e877d8ce7d4c1294989983d459af428", "ja": "目玉は、環の新曲お披露目だ。\nよろしく頼むな！", "zh": "这次的重头戏，是环的新歌首次亮相。\n就拜托你们了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_1017_040tam", "source_sha256": "c205b2c471a38182e0bcc5967262e9fb95ad304844b5cf86328fcc8810a10f9f", "ja": "新曲……たまきの！！？", "zh": "新歌……环的！！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_1018_p", "source_sha256": "946badc80aa1767d4a79d8754863ac67289ba883c7a67cf8fc5f6ef668d6fb46", "ja": "デモが届いてるから、聴いてみてくれ。\n環にピッタリな、ワクワクする曲だよ！", "zh": "试听曲已经送到了，你听听看。\n这是一首非常适合环、让人兴奋不已的歌曲！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_1019", "source_sha256": "c95ef7ba9f1b5fe7a9b636f0c350865d0ee0ac04dbaba0bfcd31003d4d4dd453", "ja": "曲をかける", "zh": "播放曲目", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_2001_040tam", "source_sha256": "cbb0f0486dd9909b8171dfb766608ff12c0fe87f74f1888db295e40635bdd8c2", "ja": "す……すっ……", "zh": "轻……轻……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_2002_040tam", "source_sha256": "02c427ca0bee40a44c81a1113590795c2dfcfb74fdd06cecdfbc3c48cbad3acd", "ja": "すごーいっ！！", "zh": "好厉害——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_2003_p", "source_sha256": "bcdc50346db8b416874285362b7586c2ecdeb4afd4d5e4f7b5429669723a823b", "ja": "おお……すごい声だな。\n気に入ったか？　環。", "zh": "哦……声音真大啊。\n喜欢吗，环？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_2004_040tam", "source_sha256": "46e0b68078543d55fd15e07672fc01f2d06b404d88e2440c583dadd013b01ef4", "ja": "うん！　すっごく気に入ったぞ～！\nおやぶん、これ本当にたまきが歌っていいの？", "zh": "嗯！我超级喜欢的～！\n老大，这首歌真的可以让环来唱吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_2005_p", "source_sha256": "dda536728c1fbff33365727429cfa57282a4a0f5f1732c937de40165a54d2550", "ja": "もちろん。環の曲だからな！", "zh": "当然，这是环的歌嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_2006_040tam", "source_sha256": "bf6d74b23922b86feae89da3d82fee67bb435576eea3c644a36d26eb94c8bf84", "ja": "やったー！\nありがとう、おやぶん！　くふふ♪", "zh": "太好了——！\n谢谢你，老大！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_2007_017kth", "source_sha256": "2bf755ab6d48cf4aa4935190eb2825ffb136a6c3026812a192983209dfc0d3b0", "ja": "明るくて楽しくて、環ちゃんにぴったりの曲だね。\nステージでは、どんなふうに表現したらいいかな……。", "zh": "明快又欢快，非常适合环的歌曲呢。\n在舞台上，要怎样表现才好呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_2008_024ann", "source_sha256": "c7b2132202ca4f9e9b81385d4bbd6a3b94d5fccbe9c005d9d30cd68081964c35", "ja": "ん……ファンのみんなが、環ちゃんと……\n遊んでる気持ちになれる……ステージ……？", "zh": "唔……能让所有的粉丝……\n都觉得是在和环一起玩的……舞台……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_2009_p", "source_sha256": "7271ad0c1a26bb79cdbae5a34b0fbe4730c2fa33fa656c0ac0b556187387cea7", "ja": "そうだな。みんなが思いっきり楽しんでいる姿を\n見せられたら、それが一番だと思うけど……。", "zh": "是啊。要是能让大家看到尽情享受的样子，我觉得那就是最好的了，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_2010_040tam", "source_sha256": "8a261f22e2219fb9e7bf650623d9a6f22577106ff361b78c6f7da9b27a832fe2", "ja": "んー…………そうだ！\nおやぶん、たまき、いいこと考えたぞ～！", "zh": "嗯——…………有了！\n老大，环想到好主意了哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_2011_p", "source_sha256": "663cbd975d9812c1583045722612018918c4adf6331fda9e0a4be03423a22d8d", "ja": "いいこと？", "zh": "好主意？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_2012_040tam", "source_sha256": "ca374b1c29288fbb4db98445b8126bde04425c95e17c6e84ee7fed7f69541b9f", "ja": "あのね、レッスンの後に、みんなで\n探検とか冒険するの！", "zh": "那个呀，练习结束后，大家一起去探险、冒险！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_2013_040tam", "source_sha256": "90e0ea87b740b2a27b62fe7269dd6bf4d6346a31e7fd08b39e35eef3eb3cfc9f", "ja": "名前はね、この曲とおんなじ『ハイホー隊』！\nそしたらぜったい、楽しいぞ～！", "zh": "名字呢，就和这首歌一样叫“嗨嗬队”！\n那样的话绝对会超开心的哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_2014_001har", "source_sha256": "5cf14c740d3352c3a87c203f6d0b7b222f1f5dd5dc36feb3cd3905d26f7efa3b", "ja": "つまり、お客さんの前に、私たちが\n環と一緒に遊んで楽しむ……ってことかな？", "zh": "也就是说，要在客人面前，和环一起玩得开心……是这个意思吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_2015_005yay", "source_sha256": "e9a49ffc36ce04722c04403e85a07debc94c8bdb67e4f9e9c4f17f3699d30f5b", "ja": "さんせー！\nみんなで、いっしょに遊びましょう！", "zh": "赞成——！\n大家一起玩吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_2016_p", "source_sha256": "10cc337b96cbb0a91ce3eee7a16f94dd4bee951fba02217c634b36bc03dcccbe", "ja": "なるほど。実際に環と探検や冒険をする事で、\n楽曲の内容にリアリティが出るかもな……ふむ。", "zh": "原来如此。通过和环一起亲身进行探索与冒险，说不定能让歌曲的内容更有真实感……嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_2017_040tam", "source_sha256": "b601a40f673c566d54e3d06133bd3baf890a4e54c2658118b799a5d639ad74e2", "ja": "おやぶん、もうお話終わった？\nじゃあみんな、さっそく探検に行くぞー！", "zh": "老大，已经聊完了吗？\n那大家马上出发去探险吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_2018_p", "source_sha256": "38a6591b38f3f0b175a29295d638b634f13699a0fed63336e0dec52b32715e54", "ja": "えっ、今から？\n……って、もういない！？　仕方ないな……！", "zh": "诶，现在就去？\n……等等，已经不见了！？真拿她没办法……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_2019_p", "source_sha256": "e7763b5cdd26bb25c56480a7a562af13ddbaaf12848de3a4678e52b0cd212265", "ja": "（環に連れられて、公園にやってきた。\n一体何をするんだろう……）", "zh": "（被环带到了公园。她到底想做什么呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_2020_040tam", "source_sha256": "f83e33be73ca9f77e8f34baeae92b582a24449ac759c8e4217ac20178b85836a", "ja": "ついたぞ～、オッホン！\nこれより、ハイホー隊の活動を始める！", "zh": "到了哦～咳哼！\n现在开始高呼队的活动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_2021_017kth", "source_sha256": "855e3a23dc63135a67e18df0acbbee73aca84362657e0386d082ae0349f3ed6b", "ja": "環ちゃん。ハイホー隊の活動って、\n具体的に何をするのかな？", "zh": "环。那个，哈伊霍队的活动，具体要做些什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_2022_040tam", "source_sha256": "8dc2502dcd5546629f2e4b1aa7c8ac978d161bf40236a5068aee76ea3ac0e7f5", "ja": "えっとね……ハイホー隊は、\n探検とか冒険をするんだぞ～！", "zh": "那个……嘿哈队就是要去探险、去冒险哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_2023_040tam", "source_sha256": "e93e617fa34c011d5ac0dfa89eeaa9f3f8c4bbfd08a85a9cb555603953a01319", "ja": "ことは、どこか探検したいところある？\nどこでもいいぞ～！", "zh": "琴叶，有没有什么想去探险的地方？\n哪里都可以哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_2024_017kth", "source_sha256": "ab02f8ea6a17f3923de11dce7d2fc1329094895929eac01a31b0585c2f956cd6", "ja": "探検したいところ……考えたことなかったな。\nえっと……。", "zh": "想去探险的地方……我还真没想过呢。\n那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_2025_017kth", "source_sha256": "c96fd7f31d6be2444fb977cbad84699e685a9dc3ddfd73fab6d4ab6ed678afe9", "ja": "あっ……さっき、環ちゃんが押し花をくれたよね？\nあのお花が咲いているところが、見てみたいかも。", "zh": "啊……刚才环送给我了压花，对吧？\n我可能想去看看那些花盛开的地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_2026_040tam", "source_sha256": "503f3912c579838da0cea97c79e0e26224adbec2f9c8ea612e521cdd324fa224", "ja": "わかった！　たまきが案内してあげるね！\nみんな、こっちだぞ～！", "zh": "知道了！环来给你们带路吧！\n大家，这边走哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_2027_040tam", "source_sha256": "58d3df85e270875b875409cbc41c89c7848420a24fd89cb40063164c5b07ebc3", "ja": "うんとね、あれがムクゲで、あっちがヤマボウシ！\nアジサイは知ってるよね？", "zh": "嗯……那个是木槿，那边的是山茱萸！\n绣球花你知道吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_2028_005yay", "source_sha256": "5cc5d2089cb8304853092acf6d0f0e11f65c52e522382e9a814aa39b5d36d845", "ja": "わっ、本当にたくさん……！\nこんなに綺麗だったんだね。", "zh": "哇，真的有好多……！\n原来这么漂亮呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_2029_024ann", "source_sha256": "2b9934c4759b68bb0c5a0312e1c756ef9d2b51cb44b44be44f2da6390396ab27", "ja": "赤い木の実とか……すごく、綺麗……。\nこれ、食べられるのかな……？", "zh": "红色的树果什么的……好漂亮……。\n这个，能吃吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_2030_040tam", "source_sha256": "de45040a2110c8d40b7fe60e295beeed377a4ccbc46d4ed457e335d12486e539", "ja": "それはユスラウメ！　甘ずっぱくておいしいぞ～。\nでも公園のは、食べちゃダメだよね？　おやぶん。", "zh": "那是樱桃梅！酸酸甜甜的，可好吃啦～  \n不过公园里的，还是不能吃吧？老大。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_2031_p", "source_sha256": "72d3bb17f1437b4b0a6726762504d20b1a4ebe9d7011caa31fb40d8042a98068", "ja": "そうだな、食べるのはやめておこうか。\n残念だけど、見るだけにしておこう。", "zh": "这样啊，那还是别吃了吧。\n虽然有点遗憾，就只看看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_2032_001har", "source_sha256": "223690e45bcf26c1773941dbab6144b0cd1cb260ef0b48a08621239310352fb7", "ja": "けど環、お花の名前、よく知ってるね。\n誰に教わったの？", "zh": "不过，环，你很了解花的名字呢。\n是谁教你的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_2033_040tam", "source_sha256": "5cb3c5fd0d65faa577edbd71275f3425187a6dcaed68e6f8dd67464aa5504465", "ja": "田舎のばあちゃんが、教えてくれたんだ！　\nばあちゃんはたまきより、いっぱい知ってるぞ～。", "zh": "是乡下奶奶教我的！  \n奶奶知道的可比环多多了哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_2034_001har", "source_sha256": "021c8f9fd073fa819343259a75a0a8e4fb8f333edbcc3965b6352808ef07498d", "ja": "環、おばあちゃんっ子なんだね！\n私もおばあちゃんには、色々教えてもらったな……♪", "zh": "小环是个奶奶控呢！\n我也从奶奶那里学到了很多……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_2035_040tam", "source_sha256": "def0b89dcee8c27d6d3a4868753139010bf67dd9384e305f8770afcbea89cd1c", "ja": "はるかも、おばあちゃん大好きなの？\nたまきとおんなじだね！　くふふ♪", "zh": "春香也最喜欢奶奶吗？\n和环一样呢！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_2036_040tam", "source_sha256": "90838c993987950ca50d9918af1093bf93cbe7cbd9d211a74d94d180b1e5c537", "ja": "ばあちゃん、元気かな……。\nたまき、なんだかばあちゃんに会いたくなっちゃった。", "zh": "奶奶现在还好吗……  \n环不知怎么的，突然想见奶奶了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_2037_p", "source_sha256": "617297b9d939bdd3666da2d35e2bd8837fb2dd9e5afb1d719df8485137f306f8", "ja": "そうか。……だったら今度の公演に、\nおばあさんを招待してみたらどうだ？", "zh": "这样啊。……那下次公演，要不要试着邀请你奶奶来？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_2038_040tam", "source_sha256": "cdee24eb6e6b9a41229548e8db973fec6a2e06c052e975c423beedb2297dfe6e", "ja": "えっ。ばあちゃんを？", "zh": "咦？邀请奶奶来？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_2039_p", "source_sha256": "5d97c79bcd4d8079ca9d36dbb8e2254bc400b59fd308a42168f63f5e51a6b97c", "ja": "環の新曲公演だしな。環が成長した姿を\n見てもらうのも、いいんじゃないか？", "zh": "毕竟是小环的新歌公演嘛。让她的爷爷奶奶看看小环成长后的样子，也不错吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_2040_040tam", "source_sha256": "fb3332f27ab24d12a99454c73f9f64d38a67aba97a81562c008b2115709852dc", "ja": "うん……わかった！\nたまき、お父さんとお母さんに聞いてみる！", "zh": "嗯……环知道了！\n环去问问爸爸和妈妈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_2041_040tam", "source_sha256": "2d3eee641206e2400276e1ec5e35e1e645cb21d007ffd7854b02a94722a774cd", "ja": "おやぶん、ありがとー！　大好き！", "zh": "老大，谢谢你——！最喜欢你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_132_2042_p", "source_sha256": "e25ea541db2f680658f1923a5b2deb1592e31e84a98e854564b6eeec927bc6b7", "ja": "（みんな、楽しそうだ。たまにはこういう\nレクリエーションもいいもんだな）", "zh": "（大家看起来都很开心。偶尔来点这样的娱乐活动也不错嘛。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
